<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Kathy, recalling the baby\'92s DNA test. \'93You mean Clinton Richard Dawkins? The genetic father?\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>At the mention of the celebrated evolutionary biologist, Solo and Chilo fell to their knees, and raised their hands to the heavens in religious ecstasy.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Praise be to The Dawkins and the wisdom of his word!\'94 Chilo incanted.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Let him be praised!\'94 Solo replied automatically.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Wisdom be The Dawkins!\'94 Chilo responded.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Kleo looked anywhere but at his colleagues, embarrassed. The glory days of the Seven Sages were apparently over. \
