<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah doubled over, clutching her belly. Little Clinton was, judging by the sensation, tap-dancing his way to future heresy.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93You heard her,\'94 Kathy announced. \'93She\'92s not keeping it.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Captain Denver snapped his notebook back into his pocket and left.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93But we came bearing gifts,\'94 Kleo insisted, trying to calm the mood, smoothing his robes, dignity in tatters.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Kathy rolled her eyes. \'93This should be good.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah slumped. \'93Fine, let\'92s get the gifts over with so you can leave.\'94\
